### Create new
POST {{url}}/categories
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "name": "wine",
  "description": "A category for all wine products"
}

### Modify
PUT {{url}}/categories/1
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "name": "wine",
  "description": "A category for all good wines"
}

### Get all
GET {{url}}/categories

### Get single
GET {{url}}/categories/1

### Delete
DELETE {{url}}/categories/1
